+    # Resolve the server's reasoning budget from its boot evidence. vLLM and
+    # SGLang print one `[effort-budget] v1 …` line at boot (effort_budget.py owns
+    # the parsing; the LAST line wins — `docker logs` spans restarts). llama.cpp
+    # prints no such line: its budget is a single server-wide boot flag
+    # (--reasoning-budget N), read from the container's resolved argv
+    # (scripts/lib/thinking-budget.sh). `_sb_out` ends up a number, `off`, or
